   "block": "hiking.ctx8",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Fun age. You could carry her in a hiking backpack and do a proper route, or let her toddle a tiny trail with lots of puddles. Which sounds more like your family?",
   "est_sec": 10.02,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "hiking.ctx8"
  },
  {
